    "text": "Sermo in festis sancte marie virginis.\nSe godspellere Lucas s\u00e6ig\u00f0 on \u00feyssen godspelle, \u00fe\u00e6t se H\u00e6lend com into sumen c\u00e6stele, & sum wif\nSeo h\u00e6fde ane suster \u00fee w\u00e6s gen\u00e6md Maria.\nSeo w\u00e6s sittende \u00e6t ures Drihtenes foten, & hlyste his worden.\nAc Martha beswanc & bestuddede \u00fea lichamlice behef\u00f0en.\nSeo stod & cw\u00e6\u00fe to \u00fean H\u00e6lende, La, Drihten, nis \u00fee na gemynde, \u00fe\u00e6t min suster l\u00e6tt me anen\nS\u00e6ge hire, \u00fe\u00e6t heo me fylste.\nSe H\u00e6lend hire andswerede & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Martha, Martha, \u00feu eart bisig & gedrefd on feale \u00feingan, ac\nMaria h\u00e6f\u00f0 gecoren \u00fe\u00e6t betste d\u00e6l, \u00fe\u00e6t hire n\u00e6fre ne by\u00f0 wi\u00f0togan.\nSume ungel\u00e6rede m\u00e6nn wundrige\u00f0, hw\u00e6t \u00feiss godspell belimpe to \u00fe\u00e6re eadigen Marien Cristes\n\u00d0es c\u00e6stel, \u00fe\u00e6re ure Drihten in com, betacne\u00f0 rihtlice \u00fe\u00e6t synderlice unw\u00e6mme m\u00e6den Maria Cristes\nFor c\u00e6stel is geclypod sum heh stepel, \u00fee by\u00f0 mid wealle betrymed, swa \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6ig\u00f0er o\u00f0re bewere\u00f0 wi\u00f0\n\u00d0yssen c\u00e6stele is rihtlice wi\u00f0meten \u00fe\u00e6t synderlice m\u00e6den Marie Cristes moder, for heo w\u00e6s f\u00e6stlice\n& for \u00fean \u00fee m\u00e6ge\u00f0had stranglice m\u00e6ig wi\u00f0standen \u00fe\u00e6re galnysse, \u00fe\u00e6t hit ne by\u00f0 \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t\n& for \u00fean \u00fee eadmodnysse wi\u00f0stant modignysse, \u00fe\u00e6t heo ne by\u00f0 \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t oferswi\u00f0en, galnysse\n& swa is m\u00e6ge\u00f0hades weall, & eadmodnysse stepel & \u00e6ig\u00f0er mid o\u00f0ren gestrangod, \u00fe\u00e6t on hire\nAc \u00e6fre hire w\u00e6s on eadmede m\u00e6ge\u00f0had, & cl\u00e6ne eadmodnysse.\nGenyme we us \u00fe\u00e6t godspell to gewittnysse hire m\u00e6ge\u00f0hades & hire eadmodnysse.\n\u00d0a \u00fea se \u00e6ngel hire cydde, \u00fe\u00e6t heo c\u00e6nnen scolde Godes Sune, heo andswerede & acsode, Hwu sceal\nGyf \u00e6nige m\u00e6dene, \u00fee h\u00e6fde gemynt were to underfone, w\u00e6re ges\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t heo scolde sune geberen, ne\nAc ea\u00f0e \u00feeos mihte axigen, Hwu sceal \u00feiss gewur\u00f0en, \u00fe\u00e6t ic sune habbe?\nFor \u00feeh heo Josepe gehandf\u00e6st w\u00e6re, \u00feehhwe\u00f0ere he h\u00e6fde anr\u00e6dlice on hire gemynte, \u00fe\u00e6t heo n\u00e6fre\nEmb hire eadmodnysse we mugen eac secgen.\n\u00d0a \u00fea se \u00e6ngel hire brohte gretinge fram heofone rice, & gewiterede heo, hwu heo w\u00e6s \u00fean H\u00e6lende to\nOn o\u00f0re stowe heo cw\u00e6\u00f0, Drihten, beseh to minre eadmodnysse, & \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t me sculen ealle m\u00e6g\u00f0en\nEale hwu heh m\u00e6den Godes moder, Hw\u00e6t mihte beon herre?\nEala hwu eadmode moder Godes \u00feinen, Hwu mihte heo eadmodlucor andswerigen?\nSume n\u00e6mme\u00f0 \u00feone c\u00e6stel Magdalum, \u00fee Maria w\u00e6s of Magdalenisc geclypod, & \u00fe\u00e6t becum\u00f0 wel to\nFor Magdalus is stepel geclypod, & betacne\u00f0 eadmodnysse.\nHere he nis beo name gecy\u00f0ed, ac is ges\u00e6d sum c\u00e6stel, & \u00fe\u00e6t nis na on idel gedon.\nFor sum c\u00e6stel, \u00fe\u00e6t is sunderlic c\u00e6stel, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6den Maria.\nFor \u00feeh manege o\u00f0re habben m\u00e6ge\u00f0hades weall, & eadmodnyssen stepel, swa \u00fe\u00e6t heo m\u00e6dene beon\nFor heo w\u00e6s synderlice moder & m\u00e6den, swa nan o\u00f0er ne mihte ne n\u00e6fre ma ne m\u00e6ig, & \u00feeh hit eall\n\u00deehhwe\u00f0ere ne fullcum\u00f0 n\u00e6fre nan to \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6r\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00feone ilca sune gebere, o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6gne his\nFor \u00fean rihtlice heo is synderlice se ilca c\u00e6stel, \u00fe\u00e6r ure Drihten in com.\n\u00de\u00e6t geat, \u00fe\u00e6r he inn com, \u00fe\u00e6t is hire geleafe.\nFor \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6ngles worden gelefde, hit wear\u00f0 fullfremod on hire \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00e6ngel hire\nNe for \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes infare, n\u00e6s se c\u00e6stel hire m\u00e6ge\u00f0hades ne hire eadmodnyssen gew\u00e6mmed.\nFor he is H\u00e6lend & na awerdend.\n\u00dea awerde \u00feing he geh\u00e6l\u00f0, & \u00fea gehale he gef\u00e6stne\u00f0 on strenc\u00f0e.\nHis weorc synden, swa swa his name sweig\u00f0.\nSum wif hine underfeng on hire hus, \u00fe\u00e6re w\u00e6s Martha to name.\nSeo h\u00e6fde ane suster \u00fee w\u00e6s geclypod Maria.\n\u00d0as twa gesustre, beo \u00fean \u00fee ure lar\u00f0eawes us cy\u00f0e\u00f0, betacnige\u00f0 \u00fea twa lif, \u00fee man l\u00e6tt on\nMartha \u00fe\u00e6t geswyncfulle lif \u00fee we one drohtnige\u00f0, Maria \u00fe\u00e6t ece lif \u00fee we to willnigen.\nMartha swanc & becarcade to gefor\u00f0igene \u00fean H\u00e6lende & his \u00feeowen \u00fea lichamlice behef\u00f0en.\nMaria f\u00e6stlice wunede abuten \u00fean H\u00e6lende & hlyste his worden.\nSeo studdede emb \u00fea uterlice \u00feing, \u00feeos o\u00f0er \u00fea inweardlice \u00feing gemyndelice besceawode.\nSwa swa ure hl\u00e6fdige is synderlice \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes moder, swa by\u00f0 eac synderlice on hire gehealdene,\nOn nanre o\u00f0re n\u00e6s Marthe studdinge on nanen time swa fullice gefor\u00f0ed toweard Gode, & toweard his\nNe Marien besceawunge, ne hire hlystinge to Godes worden, n\u00e6s n\u00e6fre on nanre o\u00f0re swa fullice\nUten nu getrehtnigen Marthen weorc, & sy\u00f0\u00f0en Marien sceawunge.\n& swa \u00fe\u00e6t we hit \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee openlucor mugen understanden, trahtnigen we hw\u00e6t o\u00f0re halgen wyrce\u00f0 on\nO\u00f0re underfo\u00f0 sumne cume leoflice for \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes lufe, ac \u00feeos n\u00e6nne o\u00f0erne cume bute \u00feone\nO\u00f0re bescryde\u00f0 sumne hnacodne mid ateorigendlicen reafe, ac \u00feeos gelichamede Godes\nO\u00f0re fede\u00f0 sumne hungrigne o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00feurstigne mid uterlicen mete o\u00f0\u00f0e dr\u00e6nce, ac \u00feeos na feorlucor\nAnd swa swa we hit mugen scortlice belucan, ealla \u00fea six mildheortnysse weorcas, \u00fee God geopene\u00f0\nSwa swa leofne gyst heo hine husede & innlice herebyregode.\n\u00d0onne he hnacod w\u00e6s, heo hine bewreah mid lichame & mid reafe.\n\u00d0onne he w\u00e6s hungrig & \u00feurstig, heo hine estlice gefylde mid hire meolca.\nOn his cildlicen unfernysse, heo hine ba\u00f0ede, & be\u00f0ede, & smerede, & b\u00e6r, & frefrede, & swa\u00f0ede, &\n\u00d0a \u00fea he w\u00e6s genumen & on rode gefestned, swa swa on cwarterne gedon, \u00fe\u00e6t heo com, swa swa hit\nOnmang \u00feyssen \u00feingen heo w\u00e6s bisig & gedrefd.\nGedrefd heo w\u00e6s, \u00fea \u00fea heo fleah into Egypte for Herode kinge, \u00fee hire Cild wolde fordon.\nGedrefd heo w\u00e6s, \u00fea \u00fea heo understod \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t Judeisce folc wi\u00f0sette hire Sune to dea\u00f0e.\n\u00c6t \u00fean \u00e6nde heo w\u00e6s inlice gedrefod, & swa swa Symeon hire hwilen \u00e6r gewitegode, his slege\nBeo hire man m\u00e6g rihtlice secgen, Martha, Martha, \u00feu eart bisig & gedrefed on feala \u00feingan.\nNe tweonige nane m\u00e6n, \u00fe\u00e6t seo gedrefde moder nolde beon gescild wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re gedrefednysse, & \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00d0\u00e6t betacne\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Martha bem\u00e6nde to \u00fean H\u00e6lende, \u00fe\u00e6t heo n\u00e6fde fultum of hire suster to \u00fean\nAc hwa m\u00e6ig, swa wur\u00f0lice swa hit gebyrede, gereccen hwu herigendlice is on \u00fe\u00e6re eadigen Cristes\nSy\u00f0\u00f0en hit is swa swa we s\u00e6den, & betere \u00feone we s\u00e6den on \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes moder, Marthan\nHwylc w\u00e6s on hire \u00fe\u00e6t d\u00e6l \u00fee Maria geceas, \u00fee ure Drihten herede & cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hit selest w\u00e6re, &\nEala hwu mycel swotnysse w\u00e6s mid \u00fe\u00e6re eadige cwen, \u00fea \u00fea se Halge Gast on hire becom, & \u00fe\u00e6s\nHw\u00e6t wanode hire of Godes wisedome, \u00fea \u00fea inne hire lutede eall Godes wisedom, & God sylf on\nSe apostel Paulus cw\u00e6\u00f0, On Criste synd beclysede Godes mihten & his wisedom, & ealle \u00fea hord\n\u00d0eos s\u00e6t wel \u00fean H\u00e6lende \u00e6t foten & \u00e6t heafde hlystinde his worden.\nHeo understod ealle \u00fea word \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6nglen, & \u00fe\u00e6re herdan, & \u00fe\u00e6re tungelwitegan, & eac for\u00f0en \u00fe\u00e6s\nN\u00e6fre \u00e6r ne \u00e6fter, nan o\u00f0er swa for\u00f0lice ne gesm\u00e6hte, hwu swote is ure Drihten.\nHeo w\u00e6s wel beo \u00fe\u00e6s witegan cwide \u00feurhdr\u00e6nct mid \u00fe\u00e6re welle Godes huse, & of \u00fean streamen his\nEmb feala \u00feing heo w\u00e6s swa swa Martha bisig & cearig.\nAnlypig \u00feing hire w\u00e6s este & gemynde swa swa Marian, for an \u00feing is beheflic, \u00fea feala \u00feing hire by\u00f0\nAc hire is Marthe d\u00e6l benumen, for heo nis na l\u00e6ng bisig to fostrigen hire Sune swa swa cilde, nu him\nNu ne carca\u00f0 heo to befleon Herodes ehtnysse into Egypte mid hire Cilde, for he is gestogan into\nNu nis heo namare gedrefd for \u00fe\u00e6re Judean ehtnysse toweard hire Sune, for ealle \u00feing him synd\nNe sculen namare \u00fea Judees hire Sune swingan ne cwellen, for he is arisen of dea\u00f0e, & ne swelt n\u00e6fre\nHeonenfor\u00f0 n\u00e6f\u00f0 se dea\u00f0 n\u00e6nne styde on him.\n\u00d0uss hire is Marthen geswyncfulle lif eall \u00e6tbroigden, & to hire freome hire is Marie d\u00e6l bel\u00e6fd, \u00fe\u00e6t\n& eall hire wille hire is gefor\u00f0ed on godnysse, for heo gesih\u00f0 hire Sune eall ealswa he is, neb wi\u00f0\n\u00d0iss is \u00fe\u00e6t seleste d\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6t hit n\u00e6fre ne by\u00f0 hire wi\u00f0togen, \u00fe\u00e6s d\u00e6les us geunne God \u00feurh hire",
